  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **DEATH GUARD** as your Army Faction, an enemy unit within Contagion Range of at least 1 **DEATH GUARD** model from your army is Afflicted. Contagion Range grows over the battle, to no more than 12\" after modifiers:\n\n- Battle round 1: 3\".\n- Battle round 2: 6\".\n- Battle round 3 onward: 9\".\n\nDuring Declare Battle Formations, pick 1 Plague. For the rest of the battle, models in an Afflicted unit lose 1 Toughness, and the unit suffers that Plague:\n\n- **Skullsquirm Blight**: its ranged attacks give their targets the **[benefit of cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**, and its melee attacks get -1 to the Hit roll.\n- **Rattlejoint Ague**: its models' Save worsens by 1.\n- **Scabrous Soulrot**: its models' Leadership, Move and Objective Control each worsen by 1, but Objective Control cannot fall below 1 this way.",
